只能傳授一等親，傳授一代將面臨消失危機，為了下一代子孫也能親身體驗當地文化，『赤麵廠』遠到日本福岡中洲將這屋台１：１帶回台灣繼續傳承。\n店內每人低消130元，可免費加麵一次!店內有販售三款拉麵:\n\n● 天神豚骨拉麵 – 天神稱之為博多、顧名思義本店採用於博多\n湯頭製作、低鈉、低油脂。搭上選用中粗面作使用、滿足男人的飽足感、女人的順口嚼進感、再加上特製香油、喝完美口湯、都會有一股香氣衝上您的味蕾上鉤了上來、這就是《赤麵廠的本店招牌》\n● 激辛豚骨拉麵 – 本店唯一一款辣味拉麵、自製特製辣醬整體吃完不會太多的負擔、激辛拉麵不會太過於辣、保有完整的豚骨香氣加上些許的辣味、是不少饕客前訪回味。\n● 藤原味噌拉麵 – 採用日本的黑味噌、比起一般白味噌來的濃厚、\n喝起來的湯頭、有多重的層次感、配上手工綁至的叉燒肉及黃金蛋、是一個完美之作。"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-v_kyeoxhBK8/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/U4mHTYqfdDM/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,[[0,"拉麵店"],"查看相似地點"],[1],"新北市中和區福真里",null,null,null,null,[[["CgIgAQ\u003d\u003d","0ahUKEwjskMKBx9KWAxVCg68BHT5fNYIQhbADCLgCKAA","全部",[["CIHM0ogKEICAgICRkaCBmgE",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/AHRPTWmk3LHJk2f_NiUUfF1ORNujcz9lGLe972YgjEU-OGG9qeGFyGMbbMdHU9mmJuYcHoX4nxv0K4VikgocgMdK6djsbXYr9CL44dqzRu3YGyfcXSfpKkr73bKLDiE27nvGLt2c0BMINw\u003dw397-h298-k-no","",[4032,3024],[203,100]],null,[[3,121.4965129,25.0023423],[0,90],[4032,3024],75],"NHuZauymCcKGvr0Pvr7VkQg","0ahUKEwjskMKBx9KWAxVCg68BHT5fNYIQzCcIuQIoAA",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[10,"CIHM0ogKEICAgICRkaCBmgE"],[10,3,[3024,4032]],null,null,[[[2],[[null,null,25.0023423,121.4965129]]]],[1,null,null,[2],null,[null,null,"bizbuilder:gmb_on_local_universal_mobile",[6,7,4,1,3]],null,null,[2023,4,4,3]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["UGCS_REFERENCE","CIHM0ogKEICAgICRkaCBmgE||","1"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["3765758591921155247","900143391127513816"],null,"KxCUupRt5CI"]],null,null,null,null,null,null,0,1,null,0],["CgIYIQ\u003d\u003d","0ahUKEwjskMKBx9KWAxVCg68BHT5fNYIQhbADCLoCKAE","菜單",[["CIABIhBCJoDBaZw5FMjhyhfj1sNi",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/AHRPTWl2Rp0WoHzZGTTKKM0Qu-g3ZdBN4ZojaIXlxqflJkrd1JDap5t0NnauVqiyWH4_0vvf77l9L9