湯，就能感覺到滿滿的麵粉味，感覺像是在喝煮過水餃的水。\n肉的部分吃起來相當像是重組肉，味道很鹹之外跟湯頭完全搭不起來。\n最後在湯裡面吃到泡麵調理包才會有的那種脫水蔬菜口感，大概這一整碗麵除了青蔥豆芽跟木耳之外，其他部分全都是調理包來的，一碗賣到260根本是在搶錢！\n\n不知道為何這家店的GOOGLE評價可以那麼高，後來也在評論內看到不少負評，希望想前來的人能看到這些評論，避開地雷",null,[0,149]]]],[null,1770977631000000,1770977631000000,"6 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfV1prNHpBOFBxd1JWbmgwRFdKWmJ6dw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfV1prNHpBOFBxd1JWbmgwRFdKWmJ6dxoTQ2d3STNfSzd6QVlRNW9pMTJRSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjskMKBx9KWAxVCg68BHT5fNYIQ_2MIjgEoCQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7920294578172927659/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHZUdJelNsbGFSbWcwVFRBeGFHRXdTalpsU0dST1VtdzViVmRyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7920294578172927659/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHZUdJelNsbGFSbWcwVFRBeGFHRXdTalpsU0dST1VtdzViVmRyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7920294578172927659/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHZUdJelNsbGFSbWcwVFRBeGFHRXdTalpsU0dST1VtdzViVmRyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7920294578172927659/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHZUdJelNsbGFSbWcwVFRBeGFHRXdTalpsU0dST1VtdzViVmRyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7920294578172927659/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHZUdJelNsbGFSbWcwVFRBeGFHRXdTalpsU0dST1VtdzViVmRyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7920294578172927659/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHZUdJelNsbGFSbWcwVFRBeGFHRXdTalpsU0dST1VtdzViVmRyUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["這位貴賓你好，每個人對吃的感受都是很個人化的，我尊重你的感受，你的意見我們也會參考與改進！但是什麼叫做煮水餃的”廢水”？！我們的評價是客人自發性的給評，怎麼叫”洗”的這麼高？！你的用字遣詞很不尊重人喔",null,[0,100]]]],[null,null,4451,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GeGIzSllaRmg0TTAxaGEwSjZlSGROUmw5bVdrRR